Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:14.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《致命弯道5：嗜血族》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,西维吉尼亚州美湖镇 1814年建镇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,1817年镇民集体消失无踪{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今原因不明{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 比利 我想你打断我的下巴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Billy. I think you broke my jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是活该 你们这些王八蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking deserve it, you assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你没事吧？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, are you okay, baby? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干嘛打扮成那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想打扮一下 庆祝山地人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the Mountain Man Festival, thought we'd dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你们的服装在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where are your costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我们没有准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没变装就不能去 那太不认真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go without a costume. It shows lack of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能等我穿好衣服后再谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have this conversation after I can get dressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错喔 比利…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, Billy. Ha-ha-ha. Grrr…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. Assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯琳韦伯 在美湖镇为大家报导…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kaleen Webber, reporting from the small town of Fairlake…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年万圣节在这里会挤满了人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, once a year, turns into a big town on Halloween…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆祝第十届山地人音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to the 10th annual Mountain Man Music Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国各地的年轻人来到美湖镇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}People from all over the country descend upon Fairlake…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个周末享受音乐 派对 到镇外的游乐园玩个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a weekend of music, partying and fun at the fairgrounds just outside town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐节规模越来越大 足以媲美对手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The festival has grown over the years to where it now rivals…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯契拉音乐节与洛拉帕洛查音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coachella and Lollapalooza.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说自由精神与喧闹群众 让他们想起火人祭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some say that its free spirit and rowdy crowds reminds them of Burning Man…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让当地警方非常担忧今晚的活动状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has local officials concerned on this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在将镜头交还给棚内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now back to you at the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去跑步 忘掉这个乱七八糟的小镇活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going for a run to get my head out of this town crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一点我会回到这里做报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you here for the live feed at 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候最好一切准备都好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything better be ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away, kid. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们得上路了 我不想迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up. We gotta get on the road. I don't wanna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 给我一分钟时间清醒一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me a minute to get up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说你是一分钟男\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard you're the one-minute man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可以保证绝对没有那回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I assure you he has no problems in that department.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我饿坏了 我得先做早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm starving. I gotta make breakfast first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少来了 比利 - 早餐一定要吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aw, come on, Billy. - You gotta start your day out right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,服装很不错 怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice costume, creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我厌倦了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌倦了你们这些孩子 只会跑趴 胡闹跟吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of you kids partying, making a mess and trying to scare people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？你吓不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what? You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 滚回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So fuck you. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！拜托！快来人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me, please! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮帮我 他们在追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please help. They're chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我想他们离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think they've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你从那些疯子手上救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. You saved me from those maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're bleeding pretty badly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得帮你包紮一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me fix that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你该谢谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thank God for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力压住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you keep pressure on that. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在这里别动 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stay here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去确定他们已经离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make sure they've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 没人了 往这边 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, it's all clear. This way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我忘记告诉你一件事 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's just one thing I forgot. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 帮个忙 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me a hand, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你这个大白癡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指屍体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus fucking Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可以让你提提神 兄弟 - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wake and bake, brother. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个邋遢鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. You're such a slob.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当是为了我 拜托你保持乾净一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you try and be a little bit cleaner for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你看起来跟猪差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You look like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照日期跟时间 安排好所有的派对计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got all our party favors arranged by date and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这搞得我头都痛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is cutting into my overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过为了欢庆这个周末 朱利安建议我们到这里的好点子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in honor of this weekend and Julian's great idea for us to come out here…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别破例\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先是你们的一些恶习\N{\fnArial\fs30}First up, some chronic, which you're participating in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是限制级的不给糖就捣蛋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some X for when we go trick or treating…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐团一开始表演 我们就能茫翻天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some shrooms for when the bands start playing. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你已经休学两个学期\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been out of school for two semesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你爸妈是怎么说的？- 不 他们什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do your parents think? - Oh, no. They don't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望保持原状\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我是新生代企业家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, besides, you know, I'm a budding entrepreneur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛跑到这个鸟地方来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we have to come all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:08:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要庆祝山地野人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's Mountain Man, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 听着 我们也可以参加火人祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, look, we could have gone to Burning Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想开车横跨美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna drive all the way across country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里一样能玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a homegrown version of it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且山地人节的故事更有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Mountain Man has got a much more interesting story to it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克鲁丝 你知道这个故事吗？- 我不是本地人 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know the story, Cruz? - I'm not from around here, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们要去美湖镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we're going to a small town called Fairlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,建镇年代大约是1814年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was founded in 1814 or some shit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然当地矿工跟山区居民处不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently, the local miners didn't get along too well with the hill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们是在争地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it was a territory dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来好几年冲突不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was conflicts over the next couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1817年万圣节夜晚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Halloween night, 1817…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,山地人突袭全镇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the entire town was ravaged by hillbillies…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,酿成美国史上最严重集体屠杀事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the largest massacre in the state's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是找不到屍体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only problem was no bodies were found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只… 发现大量血迹 你懂的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just… Just blood. Lots of it. It was… You know, it…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,全镇的居民都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire town, every inhabitant disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此消失无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was never seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真的很可怕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awful. Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说山地人把屍体拖进树林里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend has it, the hillbillies hauled all the bodies up to the woods…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,生火把美湖镇民的屍体煮熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}created a huge bonfire and then they cooked the fair residents of Fairlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后吃进肚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… And then they ate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你们知道吗？我不想去了 - 别这样 宝贝 我们就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, you know what? I don't wanna go. - Oh, come on, baby, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不要庆祝大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't wanna celebrate a massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只是为了玩乐 - 那是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's innocent fun. - It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚过去 明天就离开 好吗？别这样 克鲁丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just go tonight, we'll leave tomorrow, okay? Come on, Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一晚就好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is all this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么跟你说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I told you about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过太多次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you a thousand fucking times…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别留下任何证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never leave anything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:11:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别留下任何证据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never ever leave anything behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被人发现了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if somebody found this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察会开始调查 四处打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you got oops investigating, snooping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不住在偏僻医院里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't live in some goddamn hospital in the middle of nowhere any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里离文明世界太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live closer to civilization, a lot fucking closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做这一行三十年了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been doing this for 30 years…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不必搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have never had to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我从来不会留下证据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I never leave shit behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓 你们三个大笨蛋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to fucking God, you three pinheads…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是遇见我 你们早被关起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd all be under lock and key by now if I hadn't have happened across you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们住在我家 就得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live in my fucking house now and you play by my fucking rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖照我的方式去做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do as I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我发誓我会杀了你们 管你们跟我是什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I swear to God, I will take you all down, kin or no kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她处理好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her processed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很期待这趟旅行吗？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looking forward to the trip? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像我拿着新步枪的帅模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about getting me a new.30-60 for the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,傑森真的很幸运 抽中猎熊执照乐透奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was lucky of Jason to win the bear license lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. He's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他真是个大好人 邀请我同行 - 我知道 所以我决定嫁给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, he's a good guy to invite me along. - I know. That's why I married him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的不想去？- 我还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure you don't wanna come? - I've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得学着放轻松一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to learn to relax a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是一付严肃模样 像管理军队一样指挥着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always so by-the-book. You ride us like we're in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪律 朱尼尔 它是非常好用的生活工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discipline, Junior, it's a good tool to use in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为今晚的活动准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群爱捣蛋的小鬼 超讨厌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mob of kids, such a pain in the keester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚应该少不了 酒醉闹事跟滋扰治安的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be a big night for drunk and disorderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:13:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是绿荆郡最性感的警长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is the sexiest sheriff in all of Greenbrier County?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是绿荆郡唯一的警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only sheriff in Greenbrier County.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不代表你不性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still doesn't mean you're not sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚值完第二班 现在要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I just blew off the second shift. I'm headed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱尼尔要买新步枪 这个周末跟你去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junior's buying a new rifle for your hunt this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说那不代表他会比我厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him it won't make him a better shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我已经跟他说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚餐我要做千层面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fix some lasagna tonight for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我带一些过去给你吗？- 那就真的太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll stop by and bring you some? - That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来前先打电话联络一下 今晚应该会很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But call first. It's gonna be a busy night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会到游乐园去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may head down to the fairgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我帮你把晚餐送到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll bring it to you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会再联络 再见 老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you later. Bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再见 老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta turn this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会有二十支乐团到那里表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's supposed to be about 20 bands there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:51.05,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 谁要上台表演？- 《花豹浪女》\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, who's playing? - The Cheetah Whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纯女子乐团 她们超棒的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An all-girl band. Freaking awesome. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 葛斯最喜欢的乐团 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gus' favorite band. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她们真的那么厉害 为什么我没听说过她们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're so awesome, why haven't I heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自西岸 她们不在那里表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from the West Coast. They don't play there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对了 你何时回去？- 六月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When are you gonna go back, by the way? - Mm, June.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只待一个月 陪陪我爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just for a month to see my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比利要陪我一起去 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Billy is coming with me. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 我们会玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice. - We are gonna have an epic time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟爸妈见面？那还蛮认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meeting the folks? That's getting pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？我？认真？才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Me? Serious? Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 不 我们都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm all right. - No, we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是从哪里冒出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撞到他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did We hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.01,0:14:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去看看他是不是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should see if he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,下着雨 我根本没看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see him in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 我想他死了 - 可是我没撞到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I think he's dead. - But I didn't hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定有撞到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you! Unn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想耍我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to fuck with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up. - You piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要动 - 手放在头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freeze. - Put your hands on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他拿刀砍我 - 手放在头上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He stabbed me. - Put your hands on your head now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转身 朝我这边走过来 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn around and walk towards me. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大家在车边等着 毕格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone to wait together by your vehicle. Biggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会看着他们 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got them, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face down on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手放在背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right hand behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要厢型车支援 96号公路30英里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a wagon. Route 96, mile marker 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 马上出发 - 太棒了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy that. On its way. - Great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来那些孩子在开药局\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like we've got an entire pharmacy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐节都还没有开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the festival hasn't even started yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是漫长的一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a long night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱尼尔 你能留守在这里 等拖吊车过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junior, can you stay with the car until the tow truck arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得进行全面搜索 我不希望破坏证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we get a search? I don't wanna mess up evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美湖镇警局）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,三星期后再拆线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to have those stitches removed in about three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄好了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done here, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你赶过来 瑞克 - 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for coming, Rick. - That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道今晚你会有多忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how busy it's gonna get for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I just don't know what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被起诉的话 奖学金就会被取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get charged, they're gonna take my scholarship away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会被退学的 - 比利 你得告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can get kicked out of school. - Billy, you gotta tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是你的毒品 与我们无关 - 不 如果他说那都是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was your drugs, not ours. - No, no. If he claims it's all his…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会逮捕他 - 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- they could throw the book at him. - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.07,0:19:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害我被关在拘留所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting in jail because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道该怎么办 - 好了 别担心 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just don't know what I'm gonna do. - All right, hey, don't worry, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 我们能谈一谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, can I speak with you a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒品是我的 跟我的朋友们无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drugs are mine. My friends had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一点还有待确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's to be determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真的是我的 他们可以作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, they're mine. They'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你放了他们 我会负起责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let them go. I'll take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 反正我得为今晚预留牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm gonna need space tonight, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们哪里都不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,街的尽头有家汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a motel at the end of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 去领你们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Come get your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会带晚餐来给你 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bring you back some dinner, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他们攻击我 为什么我要被关起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw how they attacked me. Why am I being held?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,持致命武器伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assault with a deadly weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是胡说八道 - 那孩子手臂的伤口证明了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's bullshit. - The out on the boy's arm says otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你能帮我换间牢房吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, would you at least move me to another cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个酒鬼臭死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This drunk stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能撑过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里？- 我打了一小时手机找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - I've been calling her cell for the last hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没接 - 该死的爱现鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not picking up. - Freaking diva.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌选秀会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮她代打\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 你非这么做不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can and you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不准节目开天窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one goes to dead air on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在西维吉尼亚州美湖镇大街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are on Main Street in the town of Fairlake, West Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们跑到街上疯狂庆祝万圣节…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids are out for Halloween in full force…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有一群山地人加入他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're joined by a bunch of hillbillies…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起庆祝第十届山地人音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the 10th annual Mountain Man Music Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你打扮成鬼 女巫或山地人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whether you're dressed as a ghost or a witch or a hillbilly…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都能欢度万圣节…\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone is sure to have a happy Halloween…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受一流音乐表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some great music to top it all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是目前的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是薇吉妮雅凯利 现场直播新闻台报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Virginia Kelly from Live Action News.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.03,0:22:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.09,0:22:34.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（葛洛佛汽车旅馆 电暖器 有线电视 尚有空房）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是这间吗？- 应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this it? - Oh, 3, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 这是我们的床 葛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice. - This is our bed, Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:54.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小马纳德奥迪特）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你逃亡了一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like you've been running for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.01,0:23:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的亡命生涯结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your running just ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.01,0:23:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人罪没有追溯期限\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no statute of limitations for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己惹到谁了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what you've gotten yourself into, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我得填写一大堆文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of paperwork, I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国执法官办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}U. S. Marshal's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美湖镇的卡特警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is Sheriff Carter in Fairlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到一名逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a fugitive for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃亡三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been on the run for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫什么名字？- 马纳德奥迪特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's his name? - Maynard Odets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.03,0:23:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,案号是316165\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case number 316165.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天早上十点过去接他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have transport there by 10 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一大早 执法官会来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marshals will be here to pick you up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活不了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.09,0:23:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不相信你的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I highly doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.03,0:24:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I… No, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.07,0:24:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 对 但那是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's… Yeah, but it was a complete accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.09,0:24:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是… 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an a… Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子全毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car is totaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我派其他警官到游乐园 维持音乐节的秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I sent the other deputies to the fairgrounds to police the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱尼尔除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}All except Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒提醒了我 他早该回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which reminds me, he should be back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,傑森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,傑森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛汀先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brodin?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛汀先生… 手机断讯 这样也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brodin… Lost the signal. Probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说比利的爸爸气坏了 还算是轻描淡写\N{\fnArial\fs30}To say Billy's dad is pissed is the understatement of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天他会过来？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he coming tomorrow? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得比利的麻烦有多大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much trouble do you think Billy's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.07,0:25:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那一包毒品不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, there's a lot of drugs in that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.03,0:25:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他的罪名不只是行为不检\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna get off with a misdemeanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.01,0:25:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得比利会因此去坐牢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Billy's gonna go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利的爸爸会帮他找最好的律师 因为他超有钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy's dad will throw the best lawyers because Billy's dad is loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许不需要 他可能会走运 - 对 我一点都不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He might not have to. He might get lucky. - Yeah. I wouldn't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.09,0:25:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利的爸爸关系超好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy's dad's connected up to the Wazoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去参加音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so let's go to the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.07,0:25:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？朱利安 现在我们不能去参加音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Julian? We can't go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.07,0:25:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在旅馆房间也帮不了比利 有何不可呢？我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't help Billy sitting in a hotel room. Why not? We…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.05,0:25:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们大老远跑到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we came all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你提议我们怎么去参加音乐节？- 走路过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how do you propose we get there? - Uh, walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪里都不去 各位 拿去吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not going anywhere, guys. Here, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:27:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的小酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn drunk kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.03,0:27:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么一回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你闭嘴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来救我 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming for me and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.05,0:28:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.01,0:28:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要来救你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's coming for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}MY boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会挖出你的肝脏 在你面前吃掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna cut your liver out and eat it in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.02,0:28:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟这傢伙关在一起 拜托帮我换间牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be in here with this guy. Can you please put me in the other cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以回家了 莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go home, Mose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.09,0:28:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他警察在哪里？- 他们去维持音乐节秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are your deputies? - Covering the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.03,0:28:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许我该留下来？- 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I should stick around? - What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.03,0:28:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人陪你 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got nobody with you, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 莫斯 他只是个疯老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine, Mose. He's just a crazy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.02,0:29:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意 就那么决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 麻烦你帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but make yourself useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.08,0:29:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一下抽屉里有没有手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go through the drawers for the flashlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光救不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light ain't gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.05,0:29:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不闭嘴 我要以威胁警察罪名起诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't shut up, I'm gonna charge you with threatening an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.02,0:29:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管起诉我吧 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, charge away, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.09,0:29:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.01,0:29:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.09,0:29:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在这吗？- 天啊 不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.02,0:29:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我走错路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I took a wrong turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我后台怎么去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me how to get backstage?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.06,0:29:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,又走错路了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another wrong turn, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你过去 但你需要通行证才能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you, but you need a pass to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.00,0:29:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了拿到通行证 我什么都愿意做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do anything to get a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.05,0:29:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到底就是你得死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's no use talking to you Dead end, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.07,0:29:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所想的 到时她会提醒你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I'm thinking Oh, she'll remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你看到只需要一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only take a second Till you see I'm just a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.05,0:30:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕格斯警官 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy Biggs, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.03,0:30:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱尼尔 我是安琪拉 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junior, it's Angela, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.00,0:30:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 凯文 你们听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, Kevin, you guys out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所想 她到时会提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I'm thinking Oh, she'll remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来只剩你一个人了 你这个白癡贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're all alone, you dumb bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.08,0:31:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,四张90块门票 一共是260块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four tickets at 90 bucks a pop, that's 260 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.05,0:31:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.01,0:31:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能呆坐在黑夜中\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we sit around in the dark all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的太好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much fun. So much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.09,0:31:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.02,0:31:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道吗？我要送食物给比利吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm gonna go and take Billy some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得拘留所也停电了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think all the power's out in the jail as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来全镇都停电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, looks like the whole town's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.04,0:31:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不 当然全镇都停电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, of course not. The whole town's out. The whole town's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在演唱会上玩得很开心 我们也该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the concert, having a good time like we should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.09,0:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧 带着手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.09,0:31:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.02,0:32:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待会见 - 再见 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you later. - See you, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.07,0:32:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.06,0:32:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.00,0:33:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.05,0:33:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我要去找比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - I'm gonna go see Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷啊 - 我给你们一些隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cool. - I'm giving you guys some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.05,0:33:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Unn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.08,0:33:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Halloween, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.06,0:33:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.00,0:34:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.02,0:35:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来陪比利跟克鲁丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd hang out with Billy and Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.03,0:35:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁丝不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.01,0:35:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？那太奇怪了 二十分钟前她带食物来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? That's weird. She left with food about 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.06,0:35:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.09,0:35:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为她到这里来了 或许她改变了心意 回旅馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she came here. Maybe she changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.05,0:35:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,访客时间结束 明天早上再来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visiting hours are over. Come in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我不能在这里待一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. Can't I just hang out here for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.03,0:35:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你何不让他留下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why don't you let him stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.08,0:35:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下子可以多一具屍体\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more dead body to add to the pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.04,0:35:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.09,0:35:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个老混蛋一直嚷嚷着要杀了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This old bastard has been promising to kill everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.08,0:35:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他的孩子们会来救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says his boys are coming to break him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有你跟那个酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's just you and the drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.07,0:35:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说话小心点 孩子 我酒醒了 - 你最好先离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch your mouth, kid. I'm sober now. - It's probably best if you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.03,0:35:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要帮手吗？以防这傢伙是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you want another hand in case this guy's telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.06,0:36:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以待在这里等你朋友 然后你们一起回汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay until your friend gets here. Then you can walk back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.04,0:36:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么了？- 有些死小孩拿漆弹打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - Fucking kids hit me with a paint balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.05,0:36:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你该跟那女孩回汽车旅馆去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you should walk back with the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.08,0:36:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.01,0:36:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我爸谈过了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you talked to my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.02,0:36:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道 他超级火大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, he's really, really, really extremely, monumentally pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想像得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess I expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 明天一早他会来帮你办交保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he'll be here in the morning to post bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.01,0:36:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有说要用什么罪名起诉你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she say what she's charging you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.04,0:36:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说 但那些毒品足以让我的罪名成立\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't say, but there was enough stuff for a felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我搞砸了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm fucked, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他超变态的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's creepy as fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.03,0:37:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lita…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.02,0:37:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.07,0:37:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.07,0:37:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,五月时我们就要毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both graduate in May.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.01,0:37:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was thinking we could move in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.00,0:37:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 别这样 你知道我要搬到纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus, come on, you know I'm moving to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.04,0:37:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经找到工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got my job lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当会计超无聊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But accounting is so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.01,0:38:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.01,0:38:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我们谈过很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, we've talked about this a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.04,0:38:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非去不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.01,0:38:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.02,0:38:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.08,0:38:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus, I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.02,0:38:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might even love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.05,0:38:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.03,0:38:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.07,0:38:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要独处一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to spend some time on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.07,0:38:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.01,0:38:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lita, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.06,0:38:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't wanna lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.02,0:38:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.00,0:38:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.00,0:38:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在西维吉尼亚州的三流汽车旅馆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're proposing to me in some flea bag motel…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.08,0:38:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 跟我求婚？少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of West Virginia? Gus, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.03,0:38:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 心意最重要 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the thought that counts. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.05,0:38:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:38:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.01,0:39:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在朱利安回来前把衣服穿好 我得沖个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get dressed before Julian comes back. I'm gonna take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.08,0:39:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.07,0:39:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我听到了 别猴急\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I heard you. Keep your shirt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.06,0:39:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.07,0:39:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找错房间了 快滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong hotel room, pal. Move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醉到连话都说不出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you so fucking drunk you don't speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.09,0:39:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你滚开 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, move along, you dumb shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.06,0:39:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus, who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.06,0:40:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐节的酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some drunk guy from the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.02,0:40:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找错房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't find his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.09,0:40:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的服装蛮酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool costume though.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.06,0:40:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 笨蛋淋浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Fuck. Stupid thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.03,0:40:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法沖澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid shower doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.06,0:40:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冷水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.00,0:40:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.06,0:40:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我跟你的酒鬼朋友说过 你们找错房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I already told your drunk little buddy you got the wrong room.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.07,0:40:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底有什么毛病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.00,0:40:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你们是智障吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you fucking retarded?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.03,0:40:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.08,0:40:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁丝到底在哪里？她不可能到现在还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where the hell is Cruz? It can't have taken her this long to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.05,0:40:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 你要我去找她吗？- 或许她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. You want me to look for her? - She's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子们已经在街上把她抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boys already got to her on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.06,0:41:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴 老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.05,0:41:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱怎么说都可以 大学生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can say what you like, college boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.04,0:41:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your reckoning is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.03,0:41:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能叫那个死老头闭嘴吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you just shut this old bastard up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.02,0:41:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的没办法再听他胡扯下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stand listening to him any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.04,0:41:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能封住他的嘴巴 如果你是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't gag him if that's what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.00,0:41:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我五分钟时间跟他独处 他会安静一整个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me five minutes with him and he'll be quiet for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.03,0:41:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹的麻烦够多了 年轻人 别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got yourself in enough trouble, young man. Just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.06,0:41:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.02,0:41:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.00,0:42:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.00,0:42:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.00,0:42:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.00,0:42:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.07,0:43:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.03,0:43:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚还蛮有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been an interesting night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我发现停电 於是帮你带了些蜡烛过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I saw the power outage and I thought I'd bring you some candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.02,0:43:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 我很好 谢谢你 老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah, I'm fine. Thanks, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.07,0:43:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫斯 你能帮我点蜡烛吗？- 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mose, can you light some of these for me? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.06,0:43:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.00,0:43:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到一个逃犯 执法官会来接他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a fugitive who's being picked up by the marshals…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还有犯了毒品罪的小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a kid on drug charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.05,0:43:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我相信好戏才刚刚上场 - 对 或许是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I bet your night is just starting. - Heh. Yeah, probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.06,0:43:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你饿了吗？- 我饿坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hungry? - Starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不叫你的手下 回来吃三明治？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't call your deputies and come home for a sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.02,0:43:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法联络上他们 而且我该待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't reach them and besides, I should really stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.08,0:43:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们哪里都去不了 你得休息一下 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys aren't going anywhere. Take some time for yourself, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.09,0:43:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长也有午休时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the sheriff is entitled to a lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.05,0:43:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 傑森 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jason. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.09,0:43:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去做些三明治 待会帮你送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go fix some sandwiches and I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.00,0:43:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.02,0:43:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.04,0:43:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那傢伙是谁？- 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is that guy? - Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.06,0:44:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.07,0:44:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.05,0:44:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.05,0:44:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.02,0:44:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！拜托 停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.00,0:44:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.04,0:44:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.01,0:44:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.04,0:44:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.00,0:44:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我 你这个该死的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go, you crazy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.07,0:44:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.03,0:44:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.05,0:44:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.09,0:44:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你们 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,五毛钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.02,0:45:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.03,0:45:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.03,0:45:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.00,0:45:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没看过那辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I never seen the truck before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早跟你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的孩子们 他们来救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my boys. They're here to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.09,0:45:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊！- 是葛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - That's Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.05,0:46:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人啊 拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.06,0:46:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.04,0:46:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.08,0:46:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我们得把他从路上搬开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. We gotta get him out of the middle of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.07,0:46:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.07,0:46:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.09,0:46:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 死了一个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One down, huh, sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.05,0:46:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里都去不了 你得为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere and you're gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.03,0:46:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.07,0:46:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.03,0:47:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得去找克鲁丝 - 还有丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to find Cruz. - And Lita.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.07,0:47:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.05,0:47:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们都是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all deputized.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.03,0:47:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们愿意帮我 我会在法庭上帮你美言几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you help me, it will go a long way in my report to the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.05,0:47:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得去找我的女朋友 - 不 我们都得待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I wanna go after my girlfriend. - No, we all stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.06,0:47:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得等救援赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hold out until help arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.02,0:47:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯 你负责前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose, you watch the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.06,0:47:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个负责窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, cover the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.06,0:47:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要分散我们 那样子他们比较容易下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to split up. It makes it easier for them to kill us that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.05,0:47:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得待在一起 等待天亮 好了 各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we should stick together, here until dawn. Now, get to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.03,0:47:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得打电话求援 - 室内电话不通 手机也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to call for help. - Lines are dead. Cell too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.09,0:47:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 李的二手商店后面 有个短波无线电 我看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sheriff, uh, Lee has a short-wave radio in the back of his thrift store. I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.08,0:47:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要电力才能使用无线电 - 李有发电机 好点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need power to operate it. - Lee has a generator. Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.00,0:47:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要过街到他的店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm gonna go across the street to the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.06,0:47:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会利用短波无线电求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fire up the shortwave and call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.01,0:47:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我陪你去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go with you. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.08,0:47:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里 别让他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay and make sure they don't get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.09,0:47:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是个好点子 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a bright idea there, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.01,0:48:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 分开来就会死掉 记得吗？- 他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Split up and die, remember? - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.06,0:48:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拿你们的生命安全冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not risk your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.05,0:48:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作 我在街上时帮我掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my job. Now, cover me when I'm on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.08,0:48:39.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（二手商店）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.07,0:48:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.01,0:48:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.02,0:48:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.06,0:48:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? Where are you? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.08,0:49:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.05,0:49:09.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎光临李叔二手商店）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.09,0:49:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.06,0:49:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.04,0:49:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.00,0:49:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.04,0:49:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.08,0:49:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.09,0:50:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该去帮她 - 不 我答应过我会待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should go help her. - Nope. I gave my word I'd stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.05,0:50:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去帮她 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go. - Give it a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.06,0:50:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果再听到枪声 我们就去帮她 - 但我们没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just… If we hear another shot, we'll go. - But we don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.05,0:50:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不认识这个女人 她不是克鲁丝或丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know this woman. She's not Cruz or Lita.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.09,0:50:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该去找她们 等一下 - 那我们就去找女孩们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should be going after them. Just wait. - Let's go find the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.04,0:50:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一离开 他们会起诉你 等一下 看看她会不会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you leave, they'll throw the book at you. Wait a few minutes, see if she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.02,0:50:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她回来后 再跟她说我们要离开 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If she does, we'll tell her we're both going. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.04,0:51:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美湖镇卡特警长 通报紧急事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sheriff Carter of Fairlake declaring emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.02,0:51:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到吗？完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone out there? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.05,0:51:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,西维吉尼亚州美湖镇卡特警长 通报紧急事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Carter of Fair/ake, West Virginia declaring an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.07,0:51:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到吗？完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anyone hear me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.04,0:51:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, I hear you, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.07,0:51:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name and where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.08,0:51:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪塔伯特 我在新罕布夏州迪克斯维尔山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Teddy Tabet. I'm in Dixville Notch, New Hampshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.05,0:51:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 仔细听我说 泰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen to me carefully, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.04,0:51:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你打电话给 在芒兹维尔的维吉尼亚州警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to call the Virginia State Police in Moundsville.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.09,0:51:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们立刻调派所有人力到美湖镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have them send every available officer to Fairlake right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.07,0:51:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是紧急状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.07,0:51:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.03,0:51:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个山地人围攻本镇 他们想要闯入警局…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The town is under siege by three hillbillies. They're trying to break…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.08,0:51:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救被关在拘留所的亲人 他们已经杀了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of their relatives out of jail. They've already killed one person already.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.06,0:51:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说西维吉尼亚州美湖镇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say Fairlake, West Virginia?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.06,0:51:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们的电话不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's right. And we have no phone service.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.00,0:51:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你立刻打电话给州警 你能那么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need you to call the state police right away. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.03,0:51:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.02,0:52:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嗑了药吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you stoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.02,0:52:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.02,0:52:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是嗑了药或在耍我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you stoned or do you just think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.01,0:52:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么？泰迪 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, Teddy? I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.02,0:52:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚是山地人节吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's the Mountain Man Festival, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.05,0:52:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那很好玩 你能整翻州警…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it would be funny to scramble the entire state police…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.07,0:52:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你能说服某个呆瓜 帮你打电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you convinced some dork to call?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警长 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the sheriff and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态严重 泰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is serious, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.09,0:52:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 乱打电话报警是犯法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, it's a felony to file a fake police report, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.04,0:52:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是笨蛋 迪克斯维尔山口的人水准很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid. We here in Dixville Notch are a pretty savvy bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.09,0:52:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是骗不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't pull the wool over my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.09,0:52:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 晚安 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, yeah, heh, have a good night, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.04,0:52:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 拜托 听我说 泰迪 你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Please, listen, Teddy, you gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.05,0:52:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事攸关生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.07,0:52:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 那是什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. - What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.05,0:52:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.00,0:53:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你相信我了吗？混蛋 快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe me now, asshole? Just call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.01,0:53:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我打中一个了 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I got one of them. - Shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.06,0:53:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白癡 如果是警长呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiot. What if that was the sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.06,0:53:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.05,0:53:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那是葛斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Is that Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.02,0:53:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是葛斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.04,0:53:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.05,0:53:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.02,0:53:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, okay. You're all right. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.03,0:53:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian, let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.08,0:53:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事？- 这个酒鬼差点杀死我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - This drunk nearly killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.05,0:53:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.00,0:54:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不该拿枪的 - 那是个意外！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has no business carrying a gun. - It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.08,0:54:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该痛扁你一顿 - 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should beat this shit out of you! Hey, calm down. - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.09,0:54:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.07,0:54:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有受伤吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were you hit? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.04,0:54:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你看到克鲁丝了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Have you seen Cruz?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟她在一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.02,0:54:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我先出门 朱利安\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left before Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.05,0:54:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了 白马王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, lover boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.02,0:54:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许她被吞进胜子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably being digested right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.07,0:54:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子们喜欢吃人肉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boys have a taste for flesh…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.09,0:54:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是金发小美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially cute little blonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.09,0:54:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you shut the fuck up?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.06,0:54:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她真的出事 我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happened to her, I'm gonna fucking kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.06,0:54:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.06,0:54:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许其他人能活着看到天亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe the rest of them will live to see the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.07,0:54:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.04,0:54:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只有四个人 再加上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's four of you and one of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.05,0:55:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一下你们到底要不要活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think how much you wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.07,0:55:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得我们会放了你 你一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your mind if you think any one of us is gonna let you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.09,0:55:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.09,0:55:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用短波无线电 联络上任何人了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you reach anybody on the short wave?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.02,0:55:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有 - 太棒了 那代表救援很快会赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Great. That means help is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.05,0:55:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.02,0:55:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想收到讯息的笨蛋不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dumb shit on the other line, I don't think he believed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.09,0:55:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去找克鲁丝 - 我说过不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going to look for Cruz. - Hey, I told you, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.06,0:55:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你得把我关起来 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then you better lock me back up. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.01,0:55:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I may be a fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.07,0:55:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不负责任 不可靠 非常幼稚 但我非常忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm irresponsible, I'm unreliable and I'm definitely juvenile, but I am loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.03,0:55:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱克鲁丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.07,0:55:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我一生的最爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love her more than anything I've ever loved in my life…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.07,0:55:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我不会待在这里 放她一个人在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'm not gonna sit in here while she's out there on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.09,0:55:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法允许自己那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't live with myself if I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.04,0:55:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不把我关起来 要不就放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either lock me up or let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.04,0:55:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿去吧 你会需要这个 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, you're gonna need this. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.01,0:55:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起去 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going with you. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.06,0:56:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.00,0:56:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.05,0:56:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得四处看一下 试着寻找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll look around here, see if we can find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.06,0:56:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 眼睛睁大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.04,0:56:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.01,0:56:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁丝 我是比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, it's Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.08,0:56:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.09,0:56:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克鲁丝发现不对劲 她会躲起来 不肯出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Cruz knows what's up, she'll be hiding and won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.01,0:56:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.08,0:56:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望真的是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.03,0:57:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生？- 叫我莫斯就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mister? - Call me Mose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.00,0:57:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.05,0:57:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们是来救他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanna break him out, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.06,0:57:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们屠杀无辜的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But killing innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要杀死葛斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why kill Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.07,0:57:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老头被关起来的事跟他无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had nothing to do with keeping that old guy locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.00,0:57:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀人对这些傢伙来说 是稀松平常的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the feeling that killing ain't too much of a stretch for this bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.00,0:57:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有人来救我们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if no help comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.03,0:57:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会有人来救我们 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.00,0:57:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利跟朱利安呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Billy and Julian?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.08,0:57:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会找到你的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll find your friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.07,0:57:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.02,0:57:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.03,0:57:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.00,0:57:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她到底会在哪里？- 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell could she be? - I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.03,0:58:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.05,0:58:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.05,0:58:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.03,0:58:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.06,0:58:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开街道 在这里我们只能坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of the street. We're sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.02,0:58:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.06,0:58:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 克鲁丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.08,0:58:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.08,0:58:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.00,0:58:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.05,0:58:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.09,0:58:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是哪门子的禽兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of fucking animals are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.09,0:58:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们救不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do for her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.08,0:58:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带她回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.02,0:58:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要让她跟垃圾一样横屍街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave her here like some piece of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.01,0:59:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.02,0:59:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.07,1:00:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.02,1:00:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.06,1:00:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒一醒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.09,1:00:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天杀的 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.07,1:00:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 比…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, Bi…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.04,1:00:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比利 发生了什么事？- 我动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Billy, what's going on? - I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.04,1:00:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动不了 你得把链子解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't move. You gotta get out of that chain, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.09,1:00:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,链子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chain?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.08,1:00:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,解得开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get out?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.00,1:00:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.07,1:00:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死… 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. No. Just… No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.08,1:00:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck. - No, there's…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.00,1:00:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得呼救 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta call for help. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.02,1:00:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.05,1:00:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.01,1:00:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.02,1:00:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救救我们 快来人啊！- 救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help us, anybody! - Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.05,1:00:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来人啊！- 救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anybody! - Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.04,1:00:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.00,1:00:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.02,1:00:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.03,1:00:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my, God. Oh, my, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.03,1:01:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.02,1:01:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.09,1:01:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.04,1:01:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.01,1:01:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.09,1:01:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian. Julian, save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.00,1:01:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我… 快帮我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save… Help me, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.04,1:01:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么… 搞毛线呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.09,1:01:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't. No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.08,1:01:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.04,1:01:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要… 丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't… Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.07,1:01:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安 不要丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian, don't leave me. Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.05,1:01:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.00,1:01:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.00,1:01:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安！停下来 你这个混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian! Stop it, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.00,1:02:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.09,1:03:12.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（主队 客队）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.09,1:03:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能整晚待在这里 等他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't sit here all night and wait for them to come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.08,1:03:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得派人去求救 - 对 那个人就是你 莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody needs to go for help. - Yes, and that has to be you, Mose.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你办得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.05,1:03:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lita.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.04,1:03:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不救救自己呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you save yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.07,1:03:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.07,1:03:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服她放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convince her to let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.09,1:03:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以的 - 开我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can do it, sheriff. - Take my truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.05,1:03:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到游乐园找朱尼尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it to the fairgrounds and find Junior…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.08,1:03:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他警察 要他们回警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other deputies and bring them back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.07,1:03:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何 千万别停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not stop for anyone or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.05,1:03:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟我的孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my boys will go…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.05,1:03:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会消失在夜色里 你会很安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappear into the night. You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.06,1:04:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.02,1:04:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我要被困在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I stick around here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.05,1:04:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.02,1:04:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是大学生 动脑筋想一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a college kid. Use your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.00,1:04:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救自己跟你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save yourself and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.04,1:04:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.06,1:04:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.04,1:04:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do with a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.01,1:04:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.07,1:04:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信我 安琪拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can count on me, Angela.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.09,1:04:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前没有人相信我可以办好事情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know not too many people have counted on me in the past to do anything right…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.08,1:04:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm turning over a new leaf, starting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.03,1:04:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带救兵回来 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be back with help. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.05,1:04:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不答应他们的要求？把那个老头交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just give them what they want? Give them the old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.08,1:04:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救兵到了后再去抓他们 - 不 我要伸张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can track them when you have help. - No. I want justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.09,1:04:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸张正义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.03,1:04:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我男朋友的正义又在哪里？他的屍体就躺在门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about justice for my boyfriend whose body is lying on your porch?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.07,1:04:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯的正义又在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about justice for Gus, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.04,1:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.07,1:04:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我放了他 你永远无法为你男朋友伸张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let him go, you may never get justice for your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:05:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很遗憾你遇上这种事 但你无法改变我的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about what happened to you, but you're not changing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.02,1:05:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.02,1:05:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.07,1:05:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我车上有无线电 随时保持联络 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a radio in my truck. Keep in constant contact and be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.00,1:05:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车停在回收场旁边的加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}My truck is at the gas station by the junkyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.04,1:05:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.03,1:05:37.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警长）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.00,1:05:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 快点 拜托快发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, come on, come on, come on. Please, please, please start.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.06,1:05:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.03,1:06:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯 你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.05,1:06:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了 警长 我正要飞奔赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, sheriff. I'm on my way like a bat out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.01,1:06:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你安全抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you there in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.00,1:06:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开太快 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too fast, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.07,1:06:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.00,1:06:14.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（速限55英里）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.05,1:06:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚上公路 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting on the highway now, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.00,1:06:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.08,1:06:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.06,1:06:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不会让你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I wouldn't let you…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.01,1:06:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.01,1:06:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.00,1:06:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.04,1:06:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯？请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose? Come in, Mose.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.02,1:06:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mose?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.02,1:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利跟朱利安早该回来了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy and Julian should have been back by now, shouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.03,1:08:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.06,1:08:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.07,1:08:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.03,1:08:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.08,1:08:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.06,1:08:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无处可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no place to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.09,1:08:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一定有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a car or a truck or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.01,1:08:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫斯开走我唯一的车 - 我可以偷辆车 什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mose took my only truck. - Well, then I'll steal a car. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.04,1:08:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.06,1:08:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会接电线启动引擎吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to hot-wire a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.09,1:08:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.04,1:08:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 音乐节就要结束 我的手下都会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the festival will be over soon. My deputies will be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.03,1:08:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要再等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.07,1:08:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我等不了那么久呢？- 你没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what if I can't wait that long? - You really don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.01,1:08:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人跑到外面简直是自杀行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go out there now by yourself would be suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.07,1:08:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你跟我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.08,1:08:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.07,1:08:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩下我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two of us left.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.09,1:09:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们真的来救他 我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we possibly do if they come for him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.03,1:09:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.06,1:09:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你比他更疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're crazier than he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.05,1:09:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff. Help me, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.00,1:09:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.02,1:09:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff. Sheriff. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.04,1:09:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 拜托 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Please. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.01,1:09:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.04,1:10:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以突袭她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can surprise her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.03,1:10:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢走她的武器 逼她放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her weapon and force her to let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.03,1:10:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我办不到 - 她只是一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - She's just a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.06,1:10:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.00,1:10:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.00,1:10:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很聪明 丽塔 你太聪明了 不该死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart, Lita. Too smart to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.01,1:10:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你别烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.00,1:10:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比你的朋友都聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smarter than your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.03,1:10:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 你曾逃出我孩子的魔掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you even got away from my boys once.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.07,1:10:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有资格活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.09,1:10:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会要我的孩子们放你一马…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell my boys to let you live…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.09,1:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你愿意帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.03,1:10:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.00,1:10:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.00,1:11:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你站在那里 什么都不做 你跟那个臭女人死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and that bitch are certainly gonna die if you just stand there and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.00,1:11:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟你保证那一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can guarantee you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.04,1:11:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.05,1:11:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.02,1:11:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.07,1:11:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.04,1:11:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.08,1:11:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.08,1:11:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.01,1:11:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.07,1:11:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.03,1:11:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个声音是从哪来传来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.00,1:11:52.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（易燃气体）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.05,1:12:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在二手商店里 来吧 拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the thrift store. Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.04,1:12:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他 有人敢闯进来 格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him. If anyone comes in, shoot them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.01,1:12:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么…？你打算怎么办？- 我只能尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wha… What are you gonna do? - What I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.07,1:12:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.07,1:12:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.09,1:12:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.01,1:12:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.02,1:12:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.01,1:12:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把眼光放远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some vision.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.02,1:12:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.09,1:12:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想活下去 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wanna live, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.09,1:12:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.07,1:12:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then open this cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会离开 我的孩子们也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go away and so will my boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.08,1:13:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.05,1:13:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么能相信你呢？- 你有枪 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can I trust you? - Well, you have the gun, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.02,1:13:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You open this cell…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.05,1:13:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.02,1:13:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.03,1:13:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙在左边的枪柜上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The keys are in the gun locker to your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.04,1:13:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.07,1:13:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.09,1:13:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把锁打开就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is as simple as turning a key in a lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.00,1:13:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上握着的钥匙能救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That right there in your hand is the key to your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.06,1:13:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我放了你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let you out of here…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.00,1:13:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会放了我 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you let me go free, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.05,1:13:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你的人不会追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your men, you don't come after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.04,1:13:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的条件 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.01,1:13:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么说定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.00,1:13:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你敢搞鬼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.05,1:13:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓 我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.00,1:14:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.00,1:14:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.04,1:14:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.01,1:14:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 慢慢出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get out of here. Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.02,1:14:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.06,1:14:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔 你做了正确决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Lita, you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.01,1:14:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.08,1:14:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.07,1:14:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我说过要把眼光放远吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what I was saying about vision?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.09,1:15:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.00,1:15:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.01,1:15:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丽塔 - 我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lita? - My eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.07,1:15:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.06,1:15:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你 臭女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.02,1:15:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.04,1:15:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lita. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.03,1:15:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的眼睛 - 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My eyes. - You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.02,1:15:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会没事的 - 我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna be all right. - My eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.02,1:15:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.00,1:15:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 快点 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Go. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.04,1:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.02,1:15:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your fucking hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.02,1:15:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点… - 去死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get… - Fuck you. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你包扎止血 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bandage you to stop the bleeding, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.04,1:16:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,头往后仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your head back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.01,1:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I'm so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.02,1:16:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sweetie, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.07,1:16:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.06,1:16:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.01,1:16:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应如果我放了他 他会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised he would just leave if I let him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.02,1:16:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信他？- 我不知道还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you believed him? - I didn't know what else to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.09,1:16:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽塔 如果我们想活着看到天亮 你得听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lita, you're gonna have to listen to me if we're gonna make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.05,1:16:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能那么做吗？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you do that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.04,1:16:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.00,1:16:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢？我在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me? I'm bleeding here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.05,1:16:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你得靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.04,1:17:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意看着你死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna enjoy watching you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.03,1:17:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会比我先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you die first.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.05,1:17:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 再对我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Shoot me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.06,1:17:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把事情做个了断 - 别挑衅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it over with. - Don't tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.06,1:17:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fucking coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.00,1:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就没胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have the guts.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.00,1:17:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会到场看着他们处死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be there when they stick a needle in your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.01,1:17:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.07,1:17:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在说大话安慰自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just go right on telling yourself that, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.04,1:17:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去求援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.06,1:17:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里 什么都别做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here and don't do anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.05,1:17:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出去后会把门锁上 - 你再也回不来了 臭女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna lock the door behind me. - You ain't never coming back, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.00,1:17:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,傑森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.04,1:18:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,傑森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.07,1:18:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 傑森\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Oh, no. Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.09,1:18:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.05,1:18:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.09,1:18:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.08,1:19:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你记得这个声音 丽塔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to remember this voice, Lita…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.04,1:19:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这会是你最后听到的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's gonna be the last one you'll ever hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.05,1:19:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在你的耳边低语 然后割断你的喉咙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna whisper in your ear right before I slit your throat…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.02,1:19:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是迟早的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is only a matter of time now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.00,1:19:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.09,1:19:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我不会立刻杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I won't kill you right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.02,1:20:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我会让你多活几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll keep you alive a little while.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.02,1:20:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.04,1:20:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要强暴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm gonna fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.09,1:20:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.02,1:20:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.02,1:20:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我的三个孩子会强暴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then my three boys are gonna fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.06,1:20:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.04,1:20:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完事后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when we're done…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.06,1:20:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你的乳头割下来当纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna cut your titties off as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.02,1:20:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.00,1:20:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.09,1:20:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会更好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes it more fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.06,1:20:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃吧 小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.02,1:20:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要来抓你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm coming to get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.08,1:21:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我们团圆了 警长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, looks like we've come full circle, huh, sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.09,1:21:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱讽刺别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love irony.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.02,1:21:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？- 他们会抓到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you? - They'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.01,1:21:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}On, I highly doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备离开镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just fixing to leave town.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.00,1:21:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你在地狱里被烈火灼身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you burn in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.07,1:21:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你失望了 会被烈火灼身的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, sorry to disappoint, but you're the one that's gonna burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.05,1:21:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 那样就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys, that will do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.01,1:21:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 我是个好心人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sheriff, out of the kindness of my heart…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.05,1:21:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给你选择机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am offering you a choice…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.00,1:21:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是个绅士 你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is real gentleman-like of me, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.09,1:21:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.02,1:21:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.03,1:21:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拼到最后一刻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fighter to the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.08,1:21:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admirable.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.07,1:21:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.00,1:22:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个好心人 我跟你解释一下我要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I am a man of mercy, let me explain to you what is happening here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.03,1:22:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用胶带将霰弹枪黏在你嘴巴上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna duct tape this shotgun to your mouth…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.03,1:22:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,将电线绑在板机上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have attached a wire to the trigger…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.01,1:22:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一端绑在你脚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is also attached to your foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.01,1:22:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你将脚跟放下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that when you come down off your tippy-toes…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.06,1:22:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线会拉动板机\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wire is gonna pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.07,1:22:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上我是提供你一条捷径 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Essentially, I am offering you a way out, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.05,1:22:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,换作是我 我会答应的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I would take it…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.02,1:22:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为被烧死真的很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}because burning to death is one painful way to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.03,1:22:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.04,1:23:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数计时了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick tock, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.06,1:23:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.03,1:23:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 那样应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, that ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.04,1:23:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你只要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, all you have to do…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.08,1:23:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}is let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.09,1:23:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,将脚跟放下：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heels to the floor and:
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.05,1:23:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.06,1:23:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.04,1:23:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必谢我 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't need to thank me, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.02,1:23:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还撑着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hang on in there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.00,1:24:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 该离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.06,1:25:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.01,1:25:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.08,1:25:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.02,1:25:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.05,1:25:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.09,1:25:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.02,1:25:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.04,1:25:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.02,1:25:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.00,1:25:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 你停车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God you stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.06,1:25:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.09,1:25:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得报警 他们要杀了警长 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to call the police before they kill the sheriff, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.07,1:25:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.08,1:26:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.02,1:26:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.03,1:26:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你回来 丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Lita.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.04,1:26:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.05,1:26:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha-ha! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.05,1:26:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.04,1:26:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
